# Assembled extension directories: ext/shared/ is the source, the copies inside
# ext/chromium/ and ext/firefox/ are written by tools/extension_pack.mjs (and by
# CMake for the install rules). manifest.json, background.js and README.md are
# the browser's own files and stay tracked.
